@startuml attendance-security
title Secure attendance confirmation

actor Student
actor Professor
participant "Web/Mobile Client" as Client
participant "API" as API
participant "Rate Limiter" as Limiter
database "Database" as DB
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

Professor -> Client: Open attendance
Client -> API: Authenticated request
API -> API: Verify role and section ownership
API -> DB: Create open session\nwith code HMAC/hash and expiry
API --> Client: Display code/QR

Student -> Client: Enter code or scan QR
Client -> API: Submit session reference + code/QR
API -> Limiter: Check account/session/device/IP limit
Limiter --> API: Allowed or blocked

alt Blocked
  API -> DB: Log rate-limited attempt
  API --> Client: Generic failure
else Allowed
  API -> API: Verify signed QR, expiry,\nopen session, and server time
  API -> DB: Verify active enrollment
  API -> DB: Compare keyed code digest
  API -> DB: Insert attendance record\nin transaction
  API -> Audit: Log accepted confirmation
  API --> Client: Attendance confirmed
end

note over API,DB
  Unique(session_id, student_id) prevents replay.
  Never trust identity or timestamps from the client.
end note
@enduml
